# vehje-ir. shared representation

The framework's shared program-level representation, the crate every other
framework crate depends on. The twelve Core substrate forms, the `Family`
extension trait plus effect classification, the grade vocabulary (the effect,
binding-time, lease, and assurance grades as concrete enums and bitmasks over
the reused `AccessSet` machinery), one structural-hash definition over IR
subtrees, the node builder, the arena, and interner integration. No algorithms;
the data contract the passes and targets read and write. The IR lives in
caller-provided memory. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
